  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extension, by reason of inappropriate scale, detailed design and location, would result in an unsympathetic, obtrusive and incongruous form of development, which would detrimentally impact the character and appearance of the application site and wider area. As such the proposed development is contrary to policy D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2025.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its size, design and position, would result in an overbearing impact which would result in unacceptable adverse impacts on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) D6 (Housing Quality and Standards) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2025.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
